  "identity_notes": [
    "Canonical :arbor_historian and all historical mechanism/struct/supervisor/child/stream/event/intent identities retained.",
    "Actual puller remains direct child of the canonical application; inline source adapter retains caller PID.",
    "Persistence generic product methods were verified direct delegates to Arbor.Persistence.Core with identical arguments. Core paths call that public package facade directly.",
